====================================================================================================
CASE — MotorTuning.enforceMinimum and the steering correction
====================================================================================================
  MotorTuning.MIN_EFFECTIVE_LEFT_POWER=110, MIN_EFFECTIVE_RIGHT_POWER=110 (MotorSettings.kt:14-15)
  forward pair (MotorSettings.kt:21) = (180, 128); steer clamp = +-60 (RouteFollower.Config.maxSteer)

  steer   raw left/right       after enforceMinimum   note
   -60     120 /  188             120 /  188           unchanged
   -30     150 /  158             150 /  158           unchanged
     0     180 /  128             180 /  128           unchanged
    30     210 /   98             210 /  110           right lifted 98 -> 110
    60     240 /   68             240 /  110           right lifted 68 -> 110
